fn fold_vertices(g: { cells: List[(int64, ref?(L, normal, (ref?(L, normal, (ValueType, ref?(L, normal, rec))), ref?(L, normal, rec), ref?(L, normal, rec)))), mem(normal)], cell_count: int64, slots: List[(int64, ref?(L, normal, (KeyType, ref?(L, normal, rec), ref?(L, normal, rec)))), mem(normal)], slot_root: ref?(L, normal, (KeyType, int64, int64, ref?(L, normal, rec), ref?(L, normal, rec))), compare_node: fn(KeyType, KeyType) -> :less | :equal | :greater, compare_edge_data: fn(ValueType, ValueType) -> :less | :equal | :greater, compare_value: fn(ValueType, ValueType) -> :less | :equal | :greater, edge_weight: fn(ValueType) -> ItemType, compare_weight: fn(ItemType, ItemType) -> :less | :equal | :greater, compare_item: fn(ItemType, ItemType) -> :less | :equal | :greater, region: region(L, normal), specialization_key: int64, node_count: int64, edge_count: int64, compare_node_ordering_bundle: int64, compare_edge_data_ordering_bundle: int64, edge_weight_ordering_bundle: int64, compare_weight_ordering_bundle: int64 }, init: AccType, step: fn(AccType, KeyType) -> AccType) -> AccType {
